WEBVTT

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:21.050
I rip my inescapable fate
to pieces and move forward

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:26.820
accepting the unavoidable reality in my heart

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:32.590
At the end of the sorrow and hardship

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:37.530
my writhing soul heads towards the light

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:43.370
I shout... I grant...

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:50.050
And I head past the unwavering obsessions

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:55.750
Even if just for a moment,
hold me, heart and all, in your arms

00:00:55.750 --> 00:01:00.920
So I can feel the warmth of happiness

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:06.730
I destroy... I try...

00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:13.240
I just have to live with all my might

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:18.910
I don't feel Ioneliness
since I left it somewhere

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:24.050
Kindness... sympathy...
I don't need either of them now...

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:27.810
Shine the light!

00:01:31.666 --> 00:01:33.776
I'll be with Hoshimura-san.

00:01:33.776 --> 00:01:36.936
You saw it, right?
Makina Hoshimura's aberration...

00:01:39.046 --> 00:01:44.286
I recognized that my Shikabane Hime
is an aberration and accepted it.

00:01:44.286 --> 00:01:46.046
You should see it, too.

00:01:51.156 --> 00:01:52.786
Takamasa!

00:01:59.196 --> 00:02:01.186
"Seven Stars"

00:02:05.906 --> 00:02:07.806
Oh my...

00:02:07.806 --> 00:02:10.796
This isn't my taste... but...

00:02:12.876 --> 00:02:15.516
I'm kinda looking forward to
seeing the beautiful tortured look

00:02:15.516 --> 00:02:17.886
on that Shikabane Hime's face.

00:02:17.886 --> 00:02:21.086
I'm looking forward to seeing it a little.

00:02:21.086 --> 00:02:23.816
There... it's finished.

00:02:33.366 --> 00:02:38.936
If I kill you people, Keisei would feel sad,
so I'm being obedient. That's all.

00:02:38.936 --> 00:02:40.266
Oh...

00:02:41.736 --> 00:02:44.006
Ah... Umehara!

00:02:44.006 --> 00:02:45.506
He's come to pick you up.

00:02:45.506 --> 00:02:47.516
Inspector Honda...

00:02:47.516 --> 00:02:50.216
We'll send her to the
purification chamber again.

00:02:50.216 --> 00:02:52.616
That's an order from the Gon-Dai-Sojo.

00:03:01.756 --> 00:03:04.466
It's the Dai-Sojo's own handwriting.

00:03:04.466 --> 00:03:06.296
It seals all sorts of defilement.

00:03:06.296 --> 00:03:09.636
Defilement, huh? If you say so...

00:03:09.636 --> 00:03:11.536
What're you going to do with Makina?

00:03:11.536 --> 00:03:14.266
Are you gonna throw her
out with the trash this time?

00:03:15.276 --> 00:03:16.966
You sure hate me, don't you...

00:03:22.446 --> 00:03:27.386
Where did the Genpaku take
Ouri to at a time like this?

00:03:36.496 --> 00:03:41.236
I thought it was wise of me to choose
the person with the title of Genpaku,

00:03:41.236 --> 00:03:43.736
a title for the strongest monk,
as my contracted monk...

00:03:43.736 --> 00:03:47.006
Seriously?
You seriously weren't told anything?

00:03:47.006 --> 00:03:49.666
Is it about the temple by any chance?

00:03:50.976 --> 00:03:56.816
But she didn't have time to
look for a new contracted monk.

00:03:57.616 --> 00:04:03.486
Once you have a contract, you can't
change it easily. You know that, right?

00:04:03.486 --> 00:04:08.696
Yes... You have to break the
bond just like Hoshimura-san, so...

00:04:08.696 --> 00:04:13.186
I was dragged out to battles
without knowing anything.

00:04:16.506 --> 00:04:20.706
What's the matter? You came to kill me, right?

00:04:20.706 --> 00:04:23.696
I can't help it. This is my first time.

00:04:25.646 --> 00:04:30.136
What's wrong, Shikabane killer?

00:04:39.696 --> 00:04:42.556
H-How was that?
From now on, this is what...

00:04:42.556 --> 00:04:43.526
Ah!

00:04:43.526 --> 00:04:44.516
What?

00:05:09.216 --> 00:05:11.486
Hold on a sec. Don't move.

00:05:11.486 --> 00:05:13.056
I'm not moving.

00:05:13.056 --> 00:05:16.726
There! See? See? I did okay. Right?

00:05:16.726 --> 00:05:20.216
You have worse injuries than I do.

00:05:21.836 --> 00:05:25.366
I told you that I died,
didn't I? A traffic accident.

00:05:25.366 --> 00:05:27.776
So that was... true?

00:05:27.776 --> 00:05:33.206
What? You didn't believe me?
After I took time to explain it all?

00:05:35.016 --> 00:05:39.586
Shikabane are those corpses that stay
animate even after their death due to

00:05:39.586 --> 00:05:42.556
their intense regrets and obsessions.

00:05:42.556 --> 00:05:45.086
I'm one of those Shikabane, too.

00:05:45.086 --> 00:05:47.056
But because of the Kougon Sect,

00:05:47.056 --> 00:05:49.866
I was able to become a Shikabane
that hunts other Shikabane...

00:05:49.866 --> 00:05:53.866
a Shikabane Hime, a killer of immortals...

00:05:53.866 --> 00:05:58.636
They said that I can go to
heaven if I kill 108 Shikabane.

00:05:58.636 --> 00:06:01.876
Since I wanted to go to
heaven as soon as possible,

00:06:01.876 --> 00:06:04.376
I tried choosing
the strongest contracted monk.

00:06:04.376 --> 00:06:08.716
So you chose the Genpaku,
the strongest warrior monk, huh?

00:06:08.716 --> 00:06:12.446
I never imagined that you'd be
a rookie who didn't know anything.

00:06:12.446 --> 00:06:13.886
Indeed...

00:06:17.486 --> 00:06:19.456
Are you going alone?!

00:06:19.456 --> 00:06:21.126
I have to kill him.

00:06:21.126 --> 00:06:24.066
But you aren't used to fighting, right?

00:06:24.066 --> 00:06:26.656
I died once, so...

00:06:27.396 --> 00:06:30.906
How it felt when my own
bones pierced my organs...

00:06:30.906 --> 00:06:34.776
when my body was
getting cold due to bleeding...

00:06:34.776 --> 00:06:36.766
I remember it all...

00:06:38.976 --> 00:06:41.746
But you're different.

00:06:43.016 --> 00:06:45.506
I'm sorry that I dragged you into this...

00:06:48.686 --> 00:06:50.676
If you come to this side, you'll die.

00:06:53.856 --> 00:06:58.356
Why... aren't my legs... moving?

00:06:59.636 --> 00:07:02.296
To think you took the
trouble to come to get killed...

00:07:04.706 --> 00:07:07.436
Can you kill me?

00:07:07.436 --> 00:07:08.336
What?

00:07:08.336 --> 00:07:13.016
You're weak.
You're just an ordinary Shikabane.

00:07:13.016 --> 00:07:18.506
I'll eat you. I'll eat you. I'll eat you!

00:07:30.866 --> 00:07:34.696
I killed... a Shikabane... for the first time!

00:07:47.376 --> 00:07:49.206
Die one more time!

00:07:49.986 --> 00:07:52.586
When I chose to become a Shikabane Hime,

00:07:52.586 --> 00:07:59.026
I thought that I could fight
monsters since I was already dead...

00:07:59.026 --> 00:08:01.656
and that I would finish the task quickly.

00:08:02.356 --> 00:08:07.856
But still... I'm scared of dying.

00:08:14.206 --> 00:08:15.196
What?!

00:08:17.546 --> 00:08:18.876
Dammit!

00:08:23.786 --> 00:08:24.886
Takamasa!

00:08:24.886 --> 00:08:27.076
You son of a bitch!

00:08:28.916 --> 00:08:30.076
Shikabane!

00:08:31.056 --> 00:08:32.526
This way!

00:08:46.206 --> 00:08:49.576
Ow! Ow, ow, ow! Ouch!

00:08:49.576 --> 00:08:52.206
That really hurts! Ow...

00:08:52.206 --> 00:08:54.146
Ouch!

00:08:54.146 --> 00:08:57.546
Of course, it does.
But it's better than dying.

00:08:57.546 --> 00:09:04.086
If it already hurts this bad...
I guess death would hurt even more...

00:09:04.086 --> 00:09:06.496
Why did you come to help me?

00:09:06.496 --> 00:09:09.056
I found my dad's bow.

00:09:09.056 --> 00:09:12.726
I wonder if this was the reason he
always made me take lessons in

00:09:12.726 --> 00:09:14.836
Japanese archery and kendo as a child...

00:09:14.836 --> 00:09:18.836
What? No, I mean...

00:09:18.836 --> 00:09:22.896
What else could I do?
I felt like I wanted to help you.

00:09:24.906 --> 00:09:28.176
I felt that I didn't want you to die.

00:09:28.176 --> 00:09:31.586
Well, I'm already dead, you know.

00:09:31.586 --> 00:09:35.116
But to me, you look like an ordinary girl.

00:09:35.116 --> 00:09:35.986
You fool...

00:09:35.986 --> 00:09:37.976
Am I?

00:09:40.856 --> 00:09:44.856
Congrats on your first victory.
107 Shikabane to go, huh?

00:09:50.466 --> 00:09:52.956
To our first victory...

00:09:58.976 --> 00:10:00.876
Hey, Takamasa! Takamasa!

00:10:00.876 --> 00:10:02.146
Hm?

00:10:02.146 --> 00:10:04.646
Ouch! I told you that I have an injury there.

00:10:04.646 --> 00:10:05.846
Look over there!

00:10:05.846 --> 00:10:06.516
Hm?

00:10:06.516 --> 00:10:06.686
This is Itsuki Yamagami-kun.
She transferred to our school today.

00:10:06.686 --> 00:10:10.656
"Itsuki Yamagami"
This is Itsuki Yamagami-kun.
She transferred to our school today.

00:10:10.656 --> 00:10:13.296
"Itsuki Yamagami"
Be nice to her, everyone.

00:10:13.296 --> 00:10:13.856
"Itsuki Yamagami"
She's a huge hit, isn't she?!

00:10:13.856 --> 00:10:15.896
She's a huge hit, isn't she?!

00:10:15.896 --> 00:10:19.496
Okay, I've decided! I'll make
a move on that transfer student...

00:10:19.496 --> 00:10:22.866
Oh, shoot! She's coming this way!

00:10:22.866 --> 00:10:24.466
Hi there.

00:10:24.466 --> 00:10:29.336
I'm Tomoharu Kishibe. If you like,
I'll fill you in on this schoo...

00:10:31.506 --> 00:10:34.846
The Kougon Sect creates
family registries for us

00:10:34.846 --> 00:10:37.846
since there're times, like undercover
investigations, that we need it, too.

00:10:37.846 --> 00:10:42.316
No, no, no... not that. Why my school?

00:10:42.316 --> 00:10:44.756
I heard that the bond
becomes stronger if I stay

00:10:44.756 --> 00:10:47.596
by the contracted monk's
side as much as possible.

00:10:47.596 --> 00:10:48.896
Was it a problem?

00:10:48.896 --> 00:10:51.026
No, not really...

00:10:51.026 --> 00:10:54.366
Good! Let's work hard together, okay?!

00:10:54.366 --> 00:10:55.196
What?

00:10:55.196 --> 00:10:57.436
Oh, and treat me to ice cream!

00:10:57.436 --> 00:10:59.096
Why?

00:11:04.876 --> 00:11:09.116
The extraordinary life as a new
contracted monk and a Shikabane Hime...

00:11:09.116 --> 00:11:12.886
It's true that it was very exciting,

00:11:12.886 --> 00:11:19.526
but the ordinary life with an ordinary
girl named Itsuki, the transfer student

00:11:19.526 --> 00:11:23.126
who suddenly appeared and started
living at my house, was better.

00:11:23.126 --> 00:11:25.226
I think I know now...

00:11:25.226 --> 00:11:26.396
Hm?

00:11:26.396 --> 00:11:29.026
Why I became a Shikabane.

00:11:29.596 --> 00:11:30.766
Itsuki...

00:11:30.766 --> 00:11:34.876
When I was alive, I wasn't
doing much of anything.

00:11:34.876 --> 00:11:39.406
The fun high school girl life
that was in books and TV shows...

00:11:39.406 --> 00:11:44.386
I thought it'd come to me some day,
so I was just waiting for it.

00:11:44.386 --> 00:11:49.926
I think... that I wanted to live more...

00:11:49.926 --> 00:11:53.426
And also... to love someone...

00:11:53.426 --> 00:11:54.726
What was that?

00:11:54.726 --> 00:11:56.216
Never mind!

00:11:58.596 --> 00:12:01.666
A... Are you okay, Takamasa?

00:12:01.666 --> 00:12:03.836
Y... Yeah...

00:12:03.836 --> 00:12:05.136
Takamasa...

00:12:05.136 --> 00:12:11.106
I told you that I chose you because I wanted
to go to heaven as soon as possible, right?

00:12:11.106 --> 00:12:12.276
Hm?

00:12:12.276 --> 00:12:17.446
But now, I feel like I want to stay
in this world as long as possible.

00:12:17.446 --> 00:12:19.276
It's strange, isn't it...

00:12:25.286 --> 00:12:29.196
I feel like you're just telling
me about your love life...

00:12:29.196 --> 00:12:30.626
Wrong!

00:12:30.766 --> 00:12:37.866
Those wild fantasies that're
filling up your head never happened.

00:12:37.866 --> 00:12:39.806
What do you mean?

00:12:39.806 --> 00:12:40.776
What?

00:12:40.776 --> 00:12:45.176
Around that time, I started secluding
myself in a mountain with Master.

00:12:45.176 --> 00:12:48.446
He told me the same
thing that I told you earlier.

00:12:48.446 --> 00:12:49.946
That's...

00:12:49.946 --> 00:12:54.116
The girl before you isn't human.

00:12:54.116 --> 00:12:56.106
She's a Shikabane Hime.

00:13:08.696 --> 00:13:11.466
Are you done training
for the day, too, Itsuki?

00:13:11.466 --> 00:13:12.566
Don't do it.

00:13:12.566 --> 00:13:16.066
Oh, Master... What are you talking about?

00:13:16.336 --> 00:13:19.046
Was I not clear enough?

00:13:19.046 --> 00:13:25.046
Stop acknowledging and treating Itsuki,
a Shikabane Hime, as a human.

00:13:25.046 --> 00:13:27.416
Why's that?

00:13:27.416 --> 00:13:29.926
Shikabane Hime are aberrations.

00:13:29.926 --> 00:13:33.556
Even if they look human,
that's not their true nature.

00:13:33.556 --> 00:13:38.226
A contracted monk who can't
understand that will die without fail.

00:13:40.366 --> 00:13:42.736
Itsuki is an ordinary girl.

00:13:42.736 --> 00:13:46.676
No, she tries to live as an ordinary girl.

00:13:46.676 --> 00:13:48.206
That's her true nature.

00:13:48.206 --> 00:13:50.046
Listen, Takamasa.

00:13:50.046 --> 00:13:54.876
There used to be a contracted monk
named Akasha Shishidou. He was...

00:13:57.446 --> 00:14:01.386
Seriously?! You seriously
haven't told her your feelings yet?!

00:14:01.386 --> 00:14:07.056
It's complicated. I don't know how
long I can be with her, either, so...

00:14:07.896 --> 00:14:11.866
That's right... She'll go to heaven some day...

00:14:11.866 --> 00:14:15.966
That's all the more reason for you to
cherish the time you have now, right?

00:14:15.966 --> 00:14:18.266
I don't know the situation in detail,

00:14:18.266 --> 00:14:22.376
but if time is short, tell her
how you feel right away.

00:14:22.376 --> 00:14:23.976
But Master also said...

00:14:23.976 --> 00:14:27.246
What? Why are you making excuses?

00:14:27.246 --> 00:14:29.886
What do you mean excuses?

00:14:29.886 --> 00:14:33.876
The truth is that you're afraid of being
turned down when you tell her, isn't it...

00:14:36.786 --> 00:14:38.326
Are you stupid or what?

00:14:38.326 --> 00:14:39.586
Wha... What?!

00:14:39.586 --> 00:14:44.726
Haven't you noticed how
Itsuki-chan is always looking at you?

00:14:44.726 --> 00:14:45.896
Huh?

00:14:45.896 --> 00:14:48.666
Ever since the day she
transferred to our school,

00:14:48.666 --> 00:14:51.806
you're the only one she sees...

00:14:51.806 --> 00:14:55.506
so much so that I, the
master of love, am shocked.

00:14:55.506 --> 00:14:57.576
Tomoharu...

00:14:57.576 --> 00:14:59.106
Ah... good!

00:14:59.106 --> 00:14:59.976
Hm?

00:14:59.976 --> 00:15:01.846
I thought you already went home.

00:15:01.846 --> 00:15:03.016
It's those eyes...

00:15:03.016 --> 00:15:04.016
What?

00:15:04.016 --> 00:15:05.986
What? What is it?

00:15:05.986 --> 00:15:08.856
Well, have a good weekend, both of you!

00:15:08.856 --> 00:15:10.926
Did you say you were going
out of town, Tomoharu-kun?

00:15:10.926 --> 00:15:12.926
Going to my parent's hometown
to visit our ancestors' grave.

00:15:12.926 --> 00:15:17.126
Seriously, who cares about the dead?

00:15:17.126 --> 00:15:18.456
See ya.

00:15:20.966 --> 00:15:24.456
That was the last time I saw Tomoharu.

00:15:26.006 --> 00:15:30.646
On his way to his parent's hometown,
the car his family of four was taking

00:15:30.646 --> 00:15:35.846
fell victim to reckless driving
by a minor and fell off a cliff.

00:15:35.846 --> 00:15:35.946
"Entire family dead."
Fell victim to reckless driving
by a minor and fell off a cliff.

00:15:35.946 --> 00:15:37.286
"Entire family dead."
When the bodies of those four were found,
they were all unrecognizable.

00:15:37.286 --> 00:15:41.276
When the bodies of those four were found,
they were all unrecognizable.

00:15:45.556 --> 00:15:48.026
- Ah, Takamasa!
- That's it!

00:15:48.026 --> 00:15:49.356
What?

00:15:56.166 --> 00:15:57.466
Shirae-san!

00:15:57.466 --> 00:16:00.006
Inspector Shirae, explain the situation.

00:16:00.006 --> 00:16:03.376
What're you saying?
You just saw it, didn't you?!

00:16:03.376 --> 00:16:06.176
Briefing us on the situation is his job!

00:16:06.176 --> 00:16:07.836
Guardian Sougi...

00:16:09.376 --> 00:16:11.546
We confirmed that it was
the same Shikabane that was

00:16:11.546 --> 00:16:15.156
identified four years ago
and went into hiding.

00:16:15.156 --> 00:16:18.586
His ability to freely manipulate
the engines on 4WDs and 2WDs

00:16:18.586 --> 00:16:22.556
using the curse hasn't changed...

00:16:22.556 --> 00:16:25.226
It's the Shikabane of Tomoharu Kishibe.

00:16:25.226 --> 00:16:26.366
Tomoharu...

00:16:26.366 --> 00:16:28.396
He's the one you mentioned earlier...

00:16:28.396 --> 00:16:31.606
He became a Shikabane four years ago.

00:16:31.606 --> 00:16:36.036
First, the guys in the car that caused
his family to get into an accident

00:16:36.036 --> 00:16:38.206
were killed one after another.

00:16:38.206 --> 00:16:40.516
But it didn't end there.

00:16:40.516 --> 00:16:42.346
When he saw young people driving a car,

00:16:42.346 --> 00:16:47.086
he'd take control and steer the car
recklessly, and crash it into another car,

00:16:47.086 --> 00:16:49.186
as if he enjoyed it.

00:16:49.186 --> 00:16:51.176
But you said that was four years ago...

00:16:57.926 --> 00:17:02.136
One after another... how hard
working you Kougon Sect guys are...

00:17:02.136 --> 00:17:07.136
But I have too much energy since
I've slept for about four years.

00:17:07.136 --> 00:17:08.576
Hm?

00:17:08.576 --> 00:17:13.616
Hey, Takamasa...
and if it isn't Itsuki-chan... Eh?

00:17:13.616 --> 00:17:14.746
Tomoharu...

00:17:14.746 --> 00:17:18.246
What the heck? You guys came again?

00:17:18.246 --> 00:17:21.116
A contracted monk
and a Shikabane Hime...

00:17:21.116 --> 00:17:25.326
Sorry that I didn't know
anything at that time...

00:17:25.326 --> 00:17:29.456
But someone I met after
that told me many things...

00:17:29.456 --> 00:17:33.226
about the Kougon Sect
and Shikabane Hime.

00:17:33.226 --> 00:17:38.296
Itsuki-chan, I heard you're
a Shikabane, just like me.

00:17:39.136 --> 00:17:42.736
Tomoharu... Following our philosophy...

00:17:42.736 --> 00:17:43.946
I will return you to death.

00:17:43.946 --> 00:17:46.276
Can you kill me this time?

00:17:46.646 --> 00:17:50.476
What happened to those scars?
The ones from four years ago...

00:17:52.416 --> 00:17:54.746
Don't screw it up this time!

00:18:00.856 --> 00:18:04.196
Why... is this... Why?!

00:18:06.296 --> 00:18:08.536
Takamasa... Itsuki-chan...

00:18:08.536 --> 00:18:11.366
Tomoharu! Stop it already!

00:18:11.366 --> 00:18:14.276
What happened to me, Takamasa?

00:18:14.276 --> 00:18:16.006
You died.

00:18:16.006 --> 00:18:18.476
What're you saying, Takamasa?

00:18:18.476 --> 00:18:25.186
I was headed to grandma's with my
parents and my little sister by car.

00:18:25.186 --> 00:18:28.846
Then, we saw a flash in front of us...

00:18:29.616 --> 00:18:31.286
Oh, yeah...

00:18:31.286 --> 00:18:34.996
those idiots drove towards us, blocking
the road by driving like it was a car race.

00:18:34.996 --> 00:18:37.696
